{"1663325186744098816":{"a":"<p>Thinking about one of my mentors. Harry P, he was a member of Dragonfly squadron.  He oversaw the demilitarization of Japan after WWII...</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EPUHs9cjhOs\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/EPUHs9cjhOs\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EPUHs9cjhOs\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 1663325186744098816</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1663325186744098816\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-05-29T23:23:22Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1663326397153128450":{"a":"<p>The most important lesson he taught me was to never let the enemy know the cards you&#x27;re holding. His parents were Japanese and American. He looked &quot;white enough&quot; to fool the Japanese generals but still spoke Japanese fluently. He always spoke through an interpreter. 🫣😁🤣</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1663326397153128450</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1663326397153128450\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-05-29T23:28:10Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}